- verb selection uses `contains` in priority order instead of retail's exact-value switch, so Nether (0x400) prints 'hit' instead of eradicate/wither/twist/scar, and multi-bit masks pick a verb where retail prints 'hit'.
These are the most frequent lines in combat chat.

